# shell: desktop
# The desktop's own pages: opened from the leaf, read by key, and
# followed to another page and back again.
wait 20
click 980 20
wait 4
menu-pick Help
wait 12
expect-title Help
expect-narrate TikuDesktop Help
note the contents page says what the keys do
expect-narrate Tab
expect-control Contents
shot /tmp/trk_help_index.png
note Tab reaches the first link and Return follows it
key Tab
wait 4
key Return
wait 12
expect-narrate Device Monitor
expect-narrate VFS Inspector
shot /tmp/trk_help_devices.png
note and Backspace comes back to the page it was read from
key BackSpace
wait 12
expect-narrate TikuDesktop Help
note a page too tall for the window moves under the page keys: the foot
note of the contents is not on the screen until End is pressed
expect-no-narrate Written for the desktop
key End
wait 8
expect-narrate Written for the desktop
key Home
wait 8
expect-narrate TikuDesktop Help
key w ctrl
wait 8
expect-no-title Help
